# The images are built from jars packaged on the host, so the build context is those three jars
# and nothing else. Above all it keeps out docker-volume/, the containers' own data - gigabytes of
# Postgres, Prometheus and Tempo files that would otherwise be sent to the daemon on every build.
**
!ragr-app/target/ragr-app-*.jar
!ragr-ingest/target/ragr-ingest-*.jar
!ragr-eval/target/ragr-eval-*.jar
